    "description": "OpenWRaw is a standalone, cross-platform reader for Waters MassLynx .raw acquisition directories, implemented in pure Rust with no dependency on vendor DLLs. Python bindings built on PyO3 integrate with Polars, PyArrow, and Pandas, providing access to functions, scans, and ion-mobility data from Waters QTof and SYNAPT instrument families.",
